                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Yes, this is an approach I'd go with. Maybe it can be simplified a bit, as there is really no big need in general helper:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.set('n', '<Leader>w', '<C-w>', { desc = '+Window' })\r\n\r\nlocal miniclue = require('mini.clue')\r\n\r\nlocal win_clues = miniclue.gen_clues.windows()\r\nlocal leader_w_clues = vim.deepcopy(win_clues)\r\nvim.tbl_map(function(c) c.keys = c.keys:gsub('^<C%-w>', '<Leader>w') end, leader_w_clues)\r\n\r\nminiclue.setup({\r\n  triggers = {\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = '<C-w>' },\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = '<Leader>w' },\r\n  },\r\n  clues = {\r\n    win_clues,\r\n    leader_w_clues,\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, this is an approach I'd go with. Maybe it can be simplified a bit, as there is really no big need in general helper:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.keymap.set('n', '&lt;Leader&gt;w', '&lt;C-w&gt;', { desc = '+Window' })\n\nlocal miniclue = require('mini.clue')\n\nlocal win_clues = miniclue.gen_clues.windows()\nlocal leader_w_clues = vim.deepcopy(win_clues)\nvim.tbl_map(function(c) c.keys = c.keys:gsub('^&lt;C%-w&gt;', '&lt;Leader&gt;w') end, leader_w_clues)\n\nminiclue.setup({\n  triggers = {\n    { mode = 'n', keys = '&lt;C-w&gt;' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = '&lt;Leader&gt;w' },\n  },\n  clues = {\n    win_clues,\n    leader_w_clues,\n  },\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;Leader&gt;w<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-w&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>+Window<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>})\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">miniclue</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>mini.clue<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">win_clues</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">miniclue</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_clues</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">windows</span>()\n<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">leader_w_clues</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">deepcopy</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">win_clues</span>)\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">tbl_map</span>(<span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">c</span>) <span class=\"pl-smi\">c</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">c</span>.<span class=\"pl-en\">keys</span>:<span class=\"pl-c1\">gsub</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>^&lt;C%-w&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;Leader&gt;w<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">leader_w_clues</span>)\n\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">miniclue</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">triggers</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-w&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;Leader&gt;w<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n  },\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">clues</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">win_clues</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">leader_w_clues</span>,\n  },\n})</pre></div>",
                    "bodyText": "Yes, this is an approach I'd go with. Maybe it can be simplified a bit, as there is really no big need in general helper:\nvim.keymap.set('n', '<Leader>w', '<C-w>', { desc = '+Window' })\n\nlocal miniclue = require('mini.clue')\n\nlocal win_clues = miniclue.gen_clues.windows()\nlocal leader_w_clues = vim.deepcopy(win_clues)\nvim.tbl_map(function(c) c.keys = c.keys:gsub('^<C%-w>', '<Leader>w') end, leader_w_clues)\n\nminiclue.setup({\n  triggers = {\n    { mode = 'n', keys = '<C-w>' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = '<Leader>w' },\n  },\n  clues = {\n    win_clues,\n    leader_w_clues,\n  },\n})",
